        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mbuboobu Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli mbwaamba aamaanda aamumunzi uno amaanda aabami ba-Juda, aakamwayigwa kukulivuna kuzitantaala zyakusinkinizya akupanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba-Kasidi baleza kuzoolwisya akwaazuzya mitunta yabantu mbendakajaya mubukali bwangu amulunyemo lwangu, nkaambo ndasisa busyu bwangu kuzwa kumunzi uno nkaambo kabubi bwabo boonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
