        {
          "text": "Nkabela oyu munzi uyoondibeda ijwi lyakukondwa alyakutembaulwa alyabulemu kumeso aabamasi boonse baansi bayoomvwa makani oonse aacoolwe ncinzoobaletela. Bayooyoowa akukankama nkaambo kabubotu boonse acoolwe coonse ncinzooleta kulinguwo,",
          "type": "text",
